"text": "A mosquito keeps biting your ass every single night. So you slap it as hard as you can. Except you miss and slap your own face so hard, you see stars, so you light a smoky fire to chase it out, gotcha. But now you're coughing like a chimney and the mosquito is fine, so you hang a fine net over your bed. Except your fat ass rolls over in your sleep and tears right through it. So you build a box with a glowing blue light and a metal grid. Now the light lures them in, and when they touch the grid, a jolt of electricity fries them instantly. But the zap is so loud it wakes the whole fucking street. So you hang it out in the yard. Except grandpa leans on it to scratch his back. So you add a cage. Now every mosquito in town pops. Like popcorn.",
